{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "izu-no-odori",
  "chunk_id": "izu-no-odori-chunk-1984",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“人这种动物，哎呀！怎么竟能变得如此恬不知耻呢？！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "“Human beings, oh! How can they become so utterly shameless?!”",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "（刚迈出父亲诊疗室的门扉一步的妇女们。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "(The women who had just taken one step out through the door of my father’s consulting room.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "当时我还是个小孩子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "At the time, I was still a small child.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "我不知道女人究竟在什么时候才会觉得仿佛找到了新的希望。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I did not know exactly when women would feel as though they had found a new hope.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "不会知道的吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I suppose I could not have known.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "狗是66微米。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A dog is 66 micrometers.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "人是60微米。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A human is 60 micrometers.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "鲵鱼是700微米。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A salamander is 700 micrometers.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "松藻虫最长，12毫米。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The moss animal is the longest, at 12 millimeters.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "人和大猩猩的卵子都是0.13-0.14毫米。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The ova of humans and gorillas are both 0.13 to 0.14 millimeters.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "狗是0.135-0.145毫米。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A dog is 0.135 to 0.145 millimeters.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "鲸鱼也是0.14毫米。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A whale is also 0.14 millimeters.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "鸭嘴兽2.5毫米，当它从输卵管滑落下来的时候，可以膨胀到18毫米。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A platypus is 2.5 millimeters, and when it slips down from the oviduct, it can swell to 18 millimeters.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "小宠犬，我懂得童话中的算术呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Little pet dog, I understand the arithmetic in fairy tales.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "人类中的女性，也还残留着季节结婚的痕迹。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Among human women, traces of seasonal marriage still remain as well.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "他出门的时候说：今天又是晚归。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When he went out, he said: I will be late again today.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 17,
      "source_text": "又是年轻美丽的夫人与狗共进晚餐吗？）",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Will the young and beautiful lady be dining with the dog again?)",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01984",
      "unit_index": 18,
      "source_text": "夫人喜气洋洋地站在三面镜前，呼唤女佣。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The lady stood beaming before the three-sided mirror and called for the maid.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
